%% Approved roles; required subset selected by versioned measured policy.
flowchart TD
  Candidate[Candidate revision] --> Freeze[Freeze features / regime / evidence / roles / cutoff / budget]
  Freeze --> Router[Model Router]
  Router --> Market[Market Evidence Analyst]
  Router --> Event[Event Context Analyst]
  Router --> Business[Business Context Analyst]
  Router --> Challenger[Challenger]
  Router --> Historical[Historical Evidence Analyst]
  Market --> Validate[Validate schema / citations / temporal scope]
  Event --> Validate
  Business --> Validate
  Challenger --> Validate
  Historical --> Validate
  Validate -->|Required evidence returned and valid| Adjudicator[Adjudicator]
  Validate -->|Invalid or required evidence missing| Failure[Bounded retry / fail / expire]
  Adjudicator --> Proposal[Structured proposal]
  Adjudicator --> NoTrade[Defer / no-trade with reasons]
  Proposal --> PM[Portfolio Manager / no model execution authority]
